                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Where delinquency is concentrated\nHarbor Coast, Active loans = 184. Harbor Coast, Loans 30+ days past due = 10. Harbor Coast, Delinquency rate = 5.4%. Metro, Active loans = 200. Metro, Loans 30+ days past due = 9. Metro, Delinquency rate = 4.5%. Highlands, Active loans = 92. Highlands, Loans 30+ days past due = 2. Highlands, Delinquency rate = 2.2%. Valley, Active loans = 117. Valley, Loans 30+ days past due = 2. Valley, Delinquency rate = 1.7%\n- Harbor Coast has the highest delinquency rate at 5.4%; Valley has the lowest at 1.7%.\n- 74% of the loans that are 30 or more days past due were underwritten in the Fair or Poor credit band, which hold 35% of the active book.\nHarborview Community Bank  |  Credit Risk Committee, Q3 2026  |  Synthetic data for a software demonstration\n7",
