                "url": null,
                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Portfolio at a glance\nPersonal loans, Active loans = 209. Personal loans, Outstanding principal = $1,939,834. Personal loans, Average interest rate = 13.73%. Auto loans, Active loans = 251. Auto loans, Outstanding principal = $5,946,821. Auto loans, Average interest rate = 8.22%. Mortgages, Active loans = 133. Mortgages, Outstanding principal = $39,864,597. Mortgages, Average interest rate = 5.47%. All consumer loans, Active loans = 593. All consumer loans, Outstanding principal = $47,751,252. All consumer loans, Average interest rate = 9.55%\n- 593 consumer loans were active at 30 September 2026, with $47.8 million outstanding.\n- By count, 35% of active loans are personal loans, 42% are auto loans and 22% are mortgages.\n- 68 new loans were originated in the quarter (36 personal, 32 auto, 0 mortgage).\nHarborview Community Bank  |  Credit Risk Committee, Q3 2026  |  Synthetic data for a software demonstration\n2",
