                "snippet": "Default: loans 90 or more days past due\nPersonal loans, Active loans = 209. Personal loans, Loans 90+ days past due = 1. Personal loans, 90+ rate = 0.5%. Auto loans, Active loans = 251. Auto loans, Loans 90+ days past due = 7. Auto loans, 90+ rate = 2.8%. Mortgages, Active loans = 133. Mortgages, Loans 90+ days past due = 3. Mortgages, 90+ rate = 2.3%. All consumer loans, Active loans = 593. All consumer loans, Loans 90+ days past due = 11. All consumer loans, 90+ rate = 1.9%\n- 11 active loans were 90 or more days past due at 30 September, 1.9% of the portfolio.\n- 9 loans were charged off in the quarter with net charge-offs of $82,034 after recoveries.\nHarborview Community Bank  |  Credit Risk Committee, Q3 2026  |  Synthetic data for a software demonstration\n4",
