                "snippet": "Early warning indicators\n- Average credit card utilization on open cards: 31.9% in September 2026, against 27.0% in September 2025.\n- Checking accounts with at least one overdraft in the month: 18.2% in September 2026, against 16.4% a year earlier.\n- 12 cardholders are above 70 percent utilization, and 5 of them also hold a Harborview loan.\n- Customers who miss one installment are far more likely to miss the next: 50% of loans with an installment 30 or more days past due at 30 June were still unpaid or worse at 30 September.\nHarborview Community Bank  |  Credit Risk Committee, Q3 2026  |  Synthetic data for a software demonstration\n6",
